## Completion log
- 2026-11-06: Inventoried three legacy files. Kept `TODO.md` unchanged as mixed
  historical provenance, projected `dashboard.todo` once, and excluded empty
  `resume.todo`. The index and perpetual `99_DEVELOPMENT_LEDGER.todo` never become issues.
- Original applicant values, raw requests, private runtime artifacts and continuity
  are not sync inputs. Projection approval here applies only to the reviewed
  numbered content, not future unreviewed additions or the raw legacy record.
- 2026-11-06: Pilot lea-09 is issue #1 with one Done item and a verified backlink.
  Its identical rerun preserved both remote timestamps and local mapping/file bytes.
- 2026-11-06: Backfilled the other nine workstreams. Independent reconciliation
  verified ten issues, ten issue-backed items and ten persistent backlinks.
  The pre-closure checkpoint was seven closed/Done and three open; the full
  rerun reused ten, made ten no-ops and preserved remote timestamps/local files.
- 2026-11-06: Adoption issue #10 is now CLOSED/COMPLETED with its item in Done.
  Final reconciliation verified eight closed/Done and two open/In review.
  The final full rerun reused ten, created zero and made ten no-ops; independent
  before/after receipts verified unchanged content, timestamps and local files.
  This is technical completion, not human acceptance or source publication.
- 2026-11-08: Added desktop controls (#11) and portable Windows release (#12)
  under separate stable identities. Desktop offline implementation is complete;
  exact hosted release and downloaded-asset verification were initially pending.
- 2026-11-08: Published v0.2.0 from qualified source
  4c1fcb00afc36915d89e1ac911e5240e92ce22c7 through successful tag run
  42423476175. Verified the actual 109.2 MiB ZIP, 255.0 MiB installation and
  normal desktop startup. Fresh-machine, live-site and human visual acceptance
  remain separate from this bounded release completion.
- 2026-11-08: Previewed and applied only lea-11/lea-12 completion evidence.
  Independent read-back verified both CLOSED/COMPLETED and Done, with original
  #2/#9 still OPEN/In review. The settled scoped apply reported two no-ops,
  zero creates and zero blockers. Remote content/timestamps and local mapping
  plus all four selected workstream bytes/mtimes remained unchanged.
